I reached Lonavala station.
I stepped down from the train with my bag.
Immediately, I felt the cool air.
Here, the temperature was much lower than Mumbai.
My mind became very refreshed.
I went forward on the platform.
There was a vendor there.
He was selling the famous peanut chikki.
I went near him.
I said, "Bhaiya, please give me one chikki packet."
He smiled.
He gave me the chikki packet.
I put that packet in my own bag.
There was a girl there.
Her brother was also there.
The girl was not eating her own chikki.
She was eating his chikki!
I smiled gently.
Then I came out of the station, ready for the walk.
